{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_05_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_05","title":"物資回收計畫","storyCode":"OD-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"ca13fbccf4fa432d27d68579d26ca6d6eb16269622032acfec8c028d147795bd","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FROST","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"有發現嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了！雖然量不多，但是有收穫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，這些糧食加上安全屋的應急儲備，應該能夠省省勉強再過一個星期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"時候不早了，先回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......有人來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......十幾個人，可能是雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不要和他們纏鬥。快！往安全屋方向！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還跟著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不太對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道這群人肯定不會善罷甘休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡戰鬥容易被包圍，繼續撤退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"追兵。準備戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要開槍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們不是那些雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......是瑞柏巴軍人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"是本地衛兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不要動手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"衛兵，包圍這個建築！不要讓任何人跑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我們是不是被包圍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......情況不太妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"領主衛隊為什麼要包圍我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先別說話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在裡面的人，聽好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是長泉鎮衛兵隊長，長泉鎮領主之女皮加爾·圖拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在所有人都給我放下武器，乖乖地滾出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要嘗試挑戰我的耐心，你們會後悔的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵，又是雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這群無德無恥無信無義的惡徒！我那個惡貫滿盈的兄弟到底給了你們多少金子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們逃不掉的，我要碾碎你們，我要擊潰你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要讓你們為惡行付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你們死在我刀下後，你們才會知道，再多髒錢也買不來第二條性命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"喔！喔！你確定他們是來“幫忙”的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這是要把我們掛在城門口吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我最擔心的情況。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"這中間肯定是有什麼誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"皮加爾大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫是羅德島外勤幹員，代號巡林者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島與您的家族應當簽署過相關的協定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島！道貌岸然的偽君子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的父親信任你們，他相信你們的承諾，才同意這個安全屋的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你們是怎麼報答我的父親的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們綁架鎮民！掠奪他們的財富！我都看到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些背信棄義的惡徒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"但凡你有點腦子，就不該說出這麼蠢的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們的目的是掠奪這個鎮子，那我們還在這裡逗留這麼長時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花言巧語！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們又是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們拿著銃器站在我父親的領地上，還敢在這裡狡辯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你這麼厲害，之前幹什麼去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你和領主衛隊放任暴徒襲擊病人社區，拼死救人的是我們，不是你那不出動的寶貝衛隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你還跑來滿嘴胡話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜。這人不太像是能講得通道理的那類人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皮加爾大人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是感染者社區的米亞羅醫生！你以前見過我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你，我認得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島沒有劫掠感染者，我可以作證！我們是被那些暴徒趕到這裡來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不止是我，這裡的其他感染者也可以作證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皮加爾大人，請您相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信你，醫生，很多人都講述過你的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，皮加爾大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我不信任他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們未經許可手持兵械進入我父親的領地，這就是大忌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在你們保護了我父親的領民的份上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不追究你們私攜武裝的責任！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於羅德島！你們與我父親簽署的合約，即日內作廢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......請您三思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事沒什麼值得商量的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長泉鎮不需要其他武裝人員，就算是羅德島也一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會帶走所有的感染者，將他們安置在合適的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其餘的你們不需過問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不要忤逆本地領主，這裡是薩爾貢，別忘了我們現在代表羅德島的立場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領主衛兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"四十一、四十二......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領主衛兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有其他人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這些了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領主衛兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，接下來你們就安全了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寇恩小姐，亞歷山大先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間，非常感謝你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說，該說謝謝的是我們這邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們打算去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒確定呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"不要搞得這麼悲傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們以後說不定還會再見面呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"下次我還得給你講一講......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領主衛兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"TACHANKA","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......狗頭人的故事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，這個是給你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......源石錠，這我不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"是報酬，你替奧克芬治好了腿，這是羅德島給你的酬金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是簡單的急救處理......不值這麼多錢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我認為是值得的，收下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，巡林者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後......謝謝各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亞羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"這事情不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，本來以為謹慎一些總沒錯，沒想到反而產生了誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能想到這衛兵隊長是個這麼不講道理的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這蠢女人，腦袋裡面也是肌肉吧，我還以為這類人在黑鋼已經夠多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"安全屋裡的東西......基本都被他們收繳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"至少大家毫髮無傷，這已經是不幸中的萬幸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"奧克芬先生和我們一起出發吧，你可以先在辦事處那邊登記，我們向本艦聯絡之後，再一起商量後續行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"也只能這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有點不放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你指什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個叫皮加爾的人......有沒有可能她才是這一切的始作俑者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"領主遲遲沒有出現，雇傭兵一直想要綁架這些感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......現在來了一個衛兵隊長，名正言順地帶走了所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"這是不是太巧了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說的還真有點道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......我打算尾隨......去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我也去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不，太多人容易引起警覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人隨時待命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會反對這個計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"審時度勢，不和本地領主發生衝突，不代表我們什麼都不做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"有些時候，一些小詭計是必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownN"},{"type":"dialogue